WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.029 --> 00:00:03.107
- It's a good job that I am
going to the gym tonight.

00:00:03.107 --> 00:00:08.042
(hip hop style music)

00:00:09.371 --> 00:00:10.608
- Is this is just a big cookie?

00:00:10.608 --> 00:00:12.248
- It's like a cheese ball or something.

00:00:12.248 --> 00:00:13.748
- Very hard in texture.

00:00:13.748 --> 00:00:15.948
- It's sort of like flakey.

00:00:16.887 --> 00:00:17.947
- Ooo, coconuts!

00:00:17.947 --> 00:00:19.687
Oh.

00:00:19.687 --> 00:00:20.626
These are doughy.

00:00:20.626 --> 00:00:21.627
- It's not as sweet.

00:00:21.627 --> 00:00:24.067
- Maybe it would be good if
you like dunked it in tea

00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:25.907
or hot chocolate or something like that,

00:00:25.907 --> 00:00:27.387
to make it a wee bit softer.

00:00:27.387 --> 00:00:28.536
- It's actually really good.

00:00:30.046 --> 00:00:30.965
- [Girl 1] Oh, is this moon cake?

00:00:30.965 --> 00:00:32.324
- This is from like Taiwan, right?

00:00:32.324 --> 00:00:34.644
- It doesn't smell
recognizable to me at all.

00:00:34.644 --> 00:00:37.862
- Oh, it reminds me of
like a fig or something.

00:00:37.862 --> 00:00:39.522
- Mmm.

00:00:39.522 --> 00:00:41.202
- Mmm!

00:00:41.202 --> 00:00:43.101
You know, don't eat
this on the first date.

00:00:43.101 --> 00:00:44.521
- I'm still like chewing the filling.

00:00:44.521 --> 00:00:45.841
It got stuck in my teeth.

00:00:45.841 --> 00:00:47.721
- This reminds me of food we used to

00:00:47.721 --> 00:00:48.998
eat back home in Singapore.

00:00:48.998 --> 00:00:50.079
- It tastes like a Fig Newton

00:00:50.079 --> 00:00:51.526
but like, way nicer.

00:00:52.817 --> 00:00:54.397
- [Girl 2] Well, I really
hope this is not a real egg.

00:00:54.397 --> 00:00:55.057
- This is Asian.

00:00:55.057 --> 00:00:56.237
- This is like from China,

00:00:56.237 --> 00:00:58.076
but China is really big.

00:00:58.076 --> 00:00:59.276
- Oh yeah, I can see the base,

00:00:59.276 --> 00:01:01.694
it's definitely like a pastry type thing.

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:02.595
- From where I'm from,

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:04.995
we don't eat like pastries that has like,

00:01:04.995 --> 00:01:06.594
a lot of thin layers of crust.

00:01:06.594 --> 00:01:07.575
- I'm a tough Scots woman,

00:01:07.575 --> 00:01:08.875
I can handle this.

00:01:08.875 --> 00:01:12.854
(crust crumbling)

00:01:12.854 --> 00:01:13.672
- No.

00:01:13.672 --> 00:01:15.331
- This doesn't taste that sweet,

00:01:15.331 --> 00:01:15.930
for a dessert.

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:18.247
- It just tastes like a giant
ball of chocolate inside.

00:01:18.247 --> 00:01:19.867
- That was definitely an egg!

00:01:19.867 --> 00:01:21.976
- I am making a very big mess.

00:01:23.246 --> 00:01:25.325
- This looks delicious!

00:01:25.325 --> 00:01:26.904
- It's very beautifully done.

00:01:26.904 --> 00:01:30.603
- Frosting and sponge
cake and fruit inside.

00:01:30.603 --> 00:01:33.462
- This, definitely reminds
me of birthday cakes

00:01:33.462 --> 00:01:36.163
that I've had as a child
growing up in Scotland.

00:01:38.843 --> 00:01:39.862
- Mmm!

00:01:39.862 --> 00:01:41.002
- Look at that green icing.

00:01:41.002 --> 00:01:42.982
- Ooo! There's marzipan in this.

00:01:42.982 --> 00:01:44.882
- I've never seen marzipan
anywhere but England.

00:01:44.882 --> 00:01:46.702
- I don't like marzipan.

00:01:46.702 --> 00:01:48.171
- Very, very sweet.

00:01:49.341 --> 00:01:51.081
- Well this looks rather unappetizing,

00:01:51.081 --> 00:01:52.081
let's be honest.

00:01:52.081 --> 00:01:53.771
- It doesn't look dessert to me.

00:01:53.771 --> 00:01:55.939
(sniffing deeply)

00:01:55.939 --> 00:01:56.719
- Cinnamon?

00:01:56.719 --> 00:01:58.159
- It has like a little bit fruit smell

00:01:58.159 --> 00:01:59.437
but I can't tell what it is.

00:01:59.437 --> 00:02:00.458
- Almost candy.

00:02:00.458 --> 00:02:01.698
- It looks like a healthy toffee

00:02:01.698 --> 00:02:03.536
because it has sesame seeds on it.

00:02:03.536 --> 00:02:04.757
- But, it could be yummy.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.777
Oh, God, okay.

00:02:06.777 --> 00:02:07.556
Oh, it's really good.

00:02:07.556 --> 00:02:09.236
(laughs)

00:02:09.236 --> 00:02:10.774
Mmm, I like this a lot!

00:02:10.774 --> 00:02:11.612
- Watermelon.

00:02:11.612 --> 00:02:13.492
- I would see myself
eating this by the beach.

00:02:13.492 --> 00:02:16.251
- Cinnamon and gooey things.

00:02:16.251 --> 00:02:18.290
- The watermelon gave like
a very refreshing taste.

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:19.650
- These were really good desserts.

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:22.710
I feel like the US has
to step up their game.

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:26.229
(funky instrumental music)

00:02:26.229 --> 00:02:28.198
- [Voiceover] Oh yes!

